stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Baseline: Initialize State (Current Ceiling = ₹2,50,000)
    Baseline --> Extracted: Policy Circular Ingested & Clause 4.1 Extracted
    Extracted --> PatchProposed: AST Matcher Generates Unified Diff Proposal
    PatchProposed --> TestsPreRun: Execute Boundary Suite against Baseline
    TestsPreRun --> PendingApproval: Pre-Tests Completed (3/5 Pass)
    
    state PendingApproval {
        [*] --> ReviewingDiff: Review Git Diff & Citation
        ReviewingDiff --> OfficerDecision: Evaluate Risk & Boundary Matrix
    }

    PendingApproval --> Approved: Officer Click 'Approve & Apply Patch'
    PendingApproval --> Rejected: Officer Click 'Reject Patch'

    Approved --> Applied: Mutate Active Ceiling to ₹3,00,000
    Applied --> TestsPostRun: Execute Boundary Suite against Revised Ceiling
    TestsPostRun --> Audited: 5/5 PASSED & Audit Log Event Appended
    Audited --> [*]: State Synchronized with Live Simulator

    Rejected --> AuditedReject: Log Rejection Reason & Retain Baseline ₹2,50,000
    AuditedReject --> [*]: State Restored to Baseline
